        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "diamond",
        "cut": "round",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "Designed by Chaumet"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Each holds an eighteen gram piece of original Eiffel Tower iron.",
